Subject: Allocate coherent packed IOSurface storage through the IOKit service

Use a shared CPU backing file and an explicit private response instead of empty
allocation stubs. Map each handle in its own process and balance caller references,
usage counts and seeds. This does not implement GPU imports or layer presentation.

